LARD default wallpaper — `lard-default.jpg`

"a close up of water" (dark ocean surface with foam), 5760x3840.

Provided by the LARD author for inclusion in LARD as the default wallpaper.
The filename follows the Unsplash naming convention: if the photo originated on
Unsplash it is distributed under the Unsplash License (free to use, including
commercially, no attribution required):
https://unsplash.com/license

The previous default, `lard-default.png`, is an original procedural composition
(2560x1440, generated from gradients, radial glows and thin rings), released
under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
